@ref s 171ZU(1) (src:3720)
GIVEN facts IS A `s 171ZU(2) the claimant mother's case`
      `s 5(1)(a) the lower earnings limit in force at the time in pounds` IS A NUMBER
      `regulations under s 171ZU(1) provide that the claimant mother is entitled where the conditions in subsection (2) are satisfied` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 171ZW(1)(a) regulations disapply or modify a condition in the claimant mother's case` IS A BOOLEAN
