              ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Regulations may provide that, where all the conditions in subsection (2) are satisfied in relation to a person who is the mother of a child (“the claimant mother”), the claimant mother is to be entitled" (a failed "where"; reading (a))

