    `(i)(ii) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to the reduction of the duration of the maternity pay period` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(j)(i) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks the claimant would be entitled to claim if the entitlement were fully exercised` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(j)(ii) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks the claimant intends to claim` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(j)(iii) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks in respect of which M intends to claim` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(k) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the period or periods during which the claimant intends to claim` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(l)(i) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) is given by such time as may be prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(l)(ii) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) satisfies prescribed conditions as to form and content` IS A BOOLEAN
