-- src:3756 | (f) that the claimant's normal weekly earnings for a prescribed period ending with a prescribed week are not less than the lower earnings limit in force under section 5(1)(a) at the end of that week;
-- src:3757 | (g) if regulations so provide, that the claimant continues in employed earner's employment (whether or not with the employer by reference to whom the condition in paragraph (d) is satisfied) until a prescribed time;
-- src:3758 | (h) that M became entitled, by reference to the birth of the child, to—
-- src:3759 | (i) a maternity allowance, or
