-- src:3773 | (n) that it is the claimant's intention to care for the child during each week in respect of which statutory shared parental pay is paid to the claimant;
-- src:3774 | (o) that the claimant is absent from work during each week in respect of which statutory shared parental pay is paid to the claimant;
