@ref s 171ZU(4) (src:3746-3775)
GIVEN facts IS A `s 171ZU(4) the claimant's case`
      `s 5(1)(a) the lower earnings limit in force at the time in pounds` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 171ZU(4) all the conditions are satisfied` MEANS
        (facts's `(a) the claimant and M satisfy prescribed conditions as to caring or intending to care for the child`)   -- (a)
    AND ((facts's `(b)(i) the claimant satisfies prescribed conditions as to relationship with the child`) OR (facts's `(b)(ii) the claimant satisfies prescribed conditions as to relationship with M`))   -- (b)
    AND (facts's `(c)(i) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to employment or self-employment`) AND (facts's `(c)(ii) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to having earnings of a prescribed amount for a prescribed period`)   -- (c)
    AND (facts's `(d) weeks of continuous employment ending with the prescribed week`) AT LEAST (facts's `(d) the prescribed length of continuous employment in weeks`)   -- (d)
    AND (facts's `(e) at the end of that prescribed week the claimant was entitled to be in that employment`)   -- (e)
    AND (facts's `(f) normal weekly earnings in pounds for the prescribed period ending with the prescribed week`) AT LEAST `s 5(1)(a) the lower earnings limit in force at the time in pounds`   -- (f)
    AND ((NOT (facts's `(g) regulations so provide that the person continues in employed earner's employment until a prescribed time`)) OR (facts's `(g) the claimant continues in employed earner's employment until a prescribed time`))   -- (g)
    AND ((facts's `(h)(i) M became entitled, by reference to the birth of the child, to a maternity allowance`) OR (facts's `(h)(ii) M became entitled, by reference to the birth of the child, to statutory maternity pay`))   -- (h)
    AND ((facts's `(i)(i) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to the reduction of the duration of the maternity allowance period`) OR (facts's `(i)(ii) M satisfies prescribed conditions as to the reduction of the duration of the maternity pay period`))   -- (i)
    AND (facts's `(j)(i) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks the claimant would be entitled to claim if the entitlement were fully exercised`) AND (facts's `(j)(ii) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks the claimant intends to claim`) AND (facts's `(j)(iii) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the number of weeks in respect of which M intends to claim`)   -- (j)
    AND (facts's `(k) the claimant has given the person who will be liable to pay notice of the period or periods during which the claimant intends to claim`)   -- (k)
    AND (facts's `(l)(i) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) is given by such time as may be prescribed`) AND (facts's `(l)(ii) a notice under paragraph (j) or (k) satisfies prescribed conditions as to form and content`)   -- (l)
    AND (facts's `(m) M consents to the extent of the claimant's intended claim`)   -- (m)
    AND (facts's `(n) it is the claimant's intention to care for the child during each week in respect of which the pay is paid to the claimant`)   -- (n)
    AND (facts's `(o) the claimant is absent from work during each week in respect of which the pay is paid to the claimant`)   -- (o)
    AND ((NOT (facts's `(p) the person is an employee within the meaning of the Employment Rights Act 1996`)) OR (facts's `(p) the claimant's absence from work during each such week is absence on shared parental leave`))   -- (p)

